          "headline": "Metro Manila wage board approves ₱85 increase in stages",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-06-30&search=Metro%20Manila%20wage%20board%20approves%20%E2%82%B185%20increase%20in%20stages",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>DOLE announced an ₱85 daily minimum-wage increase for Metro Manila workers on June 30, to be delivered in two tranches. Contemporary reporting described an initial ₱60 adjustment followed by another ₱25 in January 2027. The staged increase promised relief for eligible workers, but households could not count on receiving the entire increase immediately.</p>",
