          "headline": "Marcos and Carney elevate Canada ties to strategic partnership",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-07-02&search=Marcos%20and%20Carney%20elevate%20Canada%20ties%20to%20strategic%20partnership",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>Marcos and Canadian Prime Minister Mark Carney met in Vancouver on July 2 and agreed to elevate relations to a strategic partnership. They prioritized cooperation in trade, energy and security and sought to conclude a bilateral free-trade agreement. The visit placed the large Filipino Canadian community within a broader diplomatic agenda, while trade negotiations remained unfinished.</p>",
