          "headline": "Marcoleta faces plunder charges over campaign donations",
          "headlineHref": "/interactive-timeline/index.html?date=2026-07-03&search=Marcoleta%20faces%20plunder%20charges%20over%20campaign%20donations",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Ombudsman filed plunder and related charges against Senator Rodante Marcoleta on July 3 over ₱75 million in allegedly undeclared campaign contributions. Marcoleta disputed the accusations; prosecutors’ filing placed the allegations before the Sandiganbayan. The case brought campaign-finance disclosure and official accountability into focus ahead of the Senate’s impeachment proceedings.</p>",
