          "descriptionHtml": "<p>The Senate impeachment court issued a July 2 notice directing Sara Duterte to appear in person or through counsel for the July 6 opening. The notice followed completion of pre-trial preparations and specified a 2 p.m. start. For viewers overseas, the development supplied a formal date to follow while leaving the merits of the case to the hearings.</p>",
